      "id": 1000949,
      "name": "[Affinity] Un-Bear-Able Rage",
      "desc": "Ben has evoked the Mindscape: <color=#FFAF2C>[Agile Adaptation]</color>. After launching a Dash Attack or Dodge Counter, your character can <color=#2BAD00>immediately follow up with</color> certain attacks near the end of the Basic Attack combo.\nAgile Adaptation: When successfully blocking enemy DMG with Ben's invulnerable effect during his <color=#FFFFFF>Special Attack</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack</color>, the following counter deals 30% more DMG.",
      "desc2": "Ben quotes an \"angry price,\" an amount most ordinary people couldn't even dream of affording. Luckily, some unsavory characters down in the Hollows are going to cover the bill.",
